  "details": "<div>This place resource describes a Roman province. There is also another place resource that treats Mauretania Tingitana simply as a geographic region:\u00a0<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"../275673\">http://pleiades.stoa.org/places/275673</a>.</div>\r\n<div>\u00a0</div>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "The Roman imperial province of Mauretania Tingitana. Located in northwest Africa, the province stretched from the Mulucha river (modern Oued Moulouia in Morocco) westward to the Atlantic.",
